    "role": "Qliphothic Lord (Thaumiel — Greater)",
    "tier": 4,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A titanic, vaguely draconic aberration with two long necks, each ending in a crowned reptilian head. One head speaks only perfect, cosmic truths; the other only absolute, universe-shattering lies. The dissonance between them warps the Wastes around it — zones where cause and effect stop being on speaking terms.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Thaumiel, the Split Crown — the Hull of Keter. This is what sits on the broken throne of unity.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'Both heads are telling you the truth about which one is lying. Shoot the body.'</em></p>",
